00:43:16.440 --> 00:43:19.740
But there are principles that are true

00:43:19.740 --> 00:43:23.550
that are true in your situation as well.

00:43:23.550 --> 00:43:25.050
Like Link said to me, I think,

00:43:27.060 --> 00:43:29.908
it's almost overused at this
point, the term "boundaries".

00:43:29.908 --> 00:43:33.847
It's used as much as people
